<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>What Changed? — {{ repo_context.repo_name }}</title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #1f2328;
    background: #f7f8fa;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }
  .container { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }

  /* Header */
  .header {
    background: #1f2328;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .header h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .header .meta { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #adb5bd; }

  /* Summary card */
  .summary-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 5px solid #ccc;
  }
  .summary-card.high  { border-left-color: #d93025; }
  .summary-card.medium { border-left-color: #f59e0b; }
  .summary-card.low   { border-left-color: #3b82d4; }

  .confidence-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .badge-high   { background: #fde8e8; color: #9b1c1c; }
  .badge-medium { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
  .badge-low    { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }

  .cause-description { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .cause-meta { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #57606a; }
  .cause-meta code {
    background: #f0f2f5;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  /* Section */
  .section {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .section h2 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #57606a;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  /* Evidence chain */
  .evidence-list { list-style: none; }
  .evidence-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f2f5;
  }
  .evidence-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .evidence-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #3b82d4;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .evidence-content { flex: 1; }
  .evidence-signal { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .evidence-detail { color: #57606a; font-size: 0.85rem; }

  /* Severity badge (inline) */
  .sev {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
  }
  .sev-high    { background: #fde8e8; color: #9b1c1c; }
  .sev-medium  { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
  .sev-low     { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }
  .sev-skipped { background: #f0f2f5; color: #57606a; }

  /* Collapsible signal sections */
  details { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  details summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    background: #f7f8fa;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    user-select: none;
  }
  details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  details summary::after { content: "▼"; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #57606a; }
  details[open] summary::after { content: "▲"; }
  details[open] summary { border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; border-bottom: none; }
  .details-body {
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-top: none;
    border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: #fff;
  }

  /* Code / diff blocks */
  pre {
    font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-x: auto;
    background: #f7f8fa;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    white-space: pre;
    max-height: 400px;
  }
  .diff-add { color: #22863a; background: #f0fff4; display: block; }
  .diff-del { color: #cb2431; background: #fff5f5; display: block; }
  .diff-hdr { color: #57606a; font-weight: 600; display: block; }

  /* Evidence lines (plain list) */
  .evidence-lines {
    font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #1f2328;
  }
  .evidence-lines p { margin: 0; padding: 0.1rem 0; }
  .evidence-lines p.add { color: #22863a; }
  .evidence-lines p.del { color: #cb2431; }
  .evidence-lines p.hdr { color: #57606a; font-weight: 600; }

  /* Alternative causes table */
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  th, td { padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  th { font-weight: 700; color: #57606a; background: #f7f8fa; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

  /* Next steps */
  .next-steps ol { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .next-steps li { padding: 0.3rem 0; }

  /* Bob chat footer */
  .bob-footer {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-left: 5px solid #7c5cd8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .bob-footer h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .bob-footer p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #57606a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .suggested-prompt {
    background: #f7f8fa;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #1f2328;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  /* Page footer */
  .page-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #57606a;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <!-- ===== HEADER ===== -->
  <div class="header">
    <h1>🔍 What Changed? — {{ repo_context.repo_name }}</h1>
    <div class="meta">
      Language: <strong>{{ repo_context.detected_language }}</strong> ·
      Framework: <strong>{{ repo_context.detected_framework }}</strong> ·
      Range: <strong>{{ repo_context.commit_range }}</strong> ·
      {{ repo_context.total_commits_analyzed }} commit(s) analysed ·
      Generated: {{ generated_at }}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== SUMMARY CARD ===== -->
  <div class="summary-card {{ analysis.confidence }}">
    <span class="confidence-badge badge-{{ analysis.confidence }}">
      {{ analysis.confidence }} confidence
    </span>
    <div class="cause-description">{{ analysis.most_likely_cause.description }}</div>
    <div class="cause-meta">
      {% if analysis.most_likely_cause.commit_sha %}
        Commit: <code>{{ analysis.most_likely_cause.commit_sha }}</code>
      {% endif %}
      {% if analysis.most_likely_cause.file %}
        · File: <code>{{ analysis.most_likely_cause.file }}</code>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== EVIDENCE CHAIN ===== -->
  {% if analysis.evidence_chain %}
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Evidence Chain</h2>
    <ul class="evidence-list">
      {% for item in analysis.evidence_chain %}
      <li>
        <div class="evidence-num">{{ loop.index }}</div>
        <div class="evidence-content">
          <div class="evidence-signal">{{ item.signal }}</div>
          <div class="evidence-detail">{{ item.detail }}</div>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===== SIGNAL DETAIL SECTIONS ===== -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Signal Details</h2>
    {% for signal in signals %}
    <details {% if signal.severity == 'high' %}open{% endif %}>
      <summary>
        <span>{{ signal.name | upper }}
          <span class="sev sev-{{ signal.severity }}">{{ signal.severity }}</span>
        </span>
        <span style="font-size:0.78rem;color:#57606a;font-weight:400;">
          {{ signal.evidence | length }} evidence item(s)
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="details-body">
        {% if signal.severity == 'skipped' %}
          <p style="color:#57606a;font-size:0.88rem;">{{ signal.evidence[0] if signal.evidence else 'No data.' }}</p>
        {% else %}
          <div class="evidence-lines">
            {% for line in signal.evidence %}
              {% if line.startswith('+') %}
                <p class="add">{{ line }}</p>
              {% elif line.startswith('-') %}
                <p class="del">{{ line }}</p>
              {% elif line.startswith('---') or line.startswith('+++') or line.startswith('@@') %}
                <p class="hdr">{{ line }}</p>
              {% elif line == '' %}
                <p>&nbsp;</p>
              {% else %}
                <p>{{ line }}</p>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <!-- ===== ALTERNATIVE CAUSES ===== -->
  {% if analysis.alternative_causes %}
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Alternative Causes</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Description</th><th style="width:8rem;">Confidence</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for alt in analysis.alternative_causes %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ alt.description }}</td>
          <td><span class="confidence-badge badge-{{ alt.confidence }}" style="margin:0;">{{ alt.confidence }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===== NEXT STEPS ===== -->
  {% if analysis.recommended_next_steps %}
  <div class="section next-steps">
    <h2>Recommended Next Steps</h2>
    <ol>
      {% for step in analysis.recommended_next_steps %}
      <li>{{ step }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===== BOB CHAT FOOTER ===== -->
  <div class="bob-footer">
    <h3>💬 Continue investigation with IBM Bob</h3>
    <p>Paste the following prompt into Bob chat to begin an interactive deep-dive:</p>
    <div class="suggested-prompt">I ran "What Changed?" on {{ repo_context.repo_name }}.
The most likely cause is: {{ analysis.most_likely_cause.description }}{% if analysis.most_likely_cause.commit_sha %} (commit {{ analysis.most_likely_cause.commit_sha }}){% endif %}.
Confidence: {{ analysis.confidence }}.
Help me verify this finding and suggest a fix.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== PAGE FOOTER ===== -->
  <div class="page-footer">
    Made with <strong>IBM Bob</strong> · What Changed? Hackathon Prototype
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
